KONOHAGAKURE — CHARTER OF THE WILL OF FIRE

Preamble: The Will of Fire is the founding spirit of the Hidden Leaf, first kindled by Hashirama Senju and tended by every Hokage since.

Principles:
- The village is a family; its shinobi are kin.
- Each generation protects the one that follows, as it was protected by the one before.
- A shinobi's strength is measured not by power alone but by what they are willing to protect.
- Those who break the rules are trash; those who abandon their comrades are worse than trash.
- The fallen are honored at the Memorial Stone, and their will is carried forward by the living.

This charter is not a code of punishment but a statement of the village's soul. Every Hokage swears to embody it. It is read to new shinobi upon registration.
Affirmed by the Office of the Hokage.
